# Authored for device/cubot/marlon.
# Author: kelexine (https://github.com/kelexine)
#
# KeyHandler (loaded into system_server per TARGET_KEY_HANDLER_LIBS) checks
# each gesture's enable state via GestureNodeController before dispatching
# an action -- that read happens in the system_server domain, distinct from
# the platform_app domain the DeviceSettings app itself uses to toggle these
# nodes. Without this, KeyHandler's enable-state checks silently fail closed
# (isEnabled() catches the denial and returns false), so every gesture would
# appear permanently disabled regardless of what the user set in Settings.
allow system_server sysfs_touchpanel:dir r_dir_perms;
allow system_server sysfs_touchpanel:file r_file_perms;
